<Information title="Privacy" description="Hosting, analytics and contact information for the phx.tools website.">
<p>This notice covers the public website at phx.tools.</p>
<h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
<p>Cloudflare Pages hosts this website. Cloudflare receives the network information needed to deliver pages and protect the site. See the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a> for its processing practices.</p>
<p>The homepage uses Plausible for website analytics. About, Contact and Privacy do not load the analytics script. The <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">Plausible data policy</a> explains how it handles analytics data.</p>
<h2>Email and external links</h2>
<p>If you email us, your message and contact details are handled through the email service used for that conversation. Links to other websites are covered by those websites’ own privacy notices.</p>
<p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:consulting@optimum.ba">consulting@optimum.ba</a>.</p>
</Information>
